= Toleration broken


The Social Democratic Party has called for a vote of no confidence against our minority cabinet despite our prior toleration agreement, due to our various policies and disagreements. If this suceeds, there will be an election in a few months. 


- @spd_assuage: Try to assuage the SPD.
- @let_it_happen: Let the vote happen.

@spd_assuage: 

How can we try to assuage the SPD?


- @resourcespd: Use our resources to calm the SPD
- @welfare: Enact a massive increase in welfare
- @let_it_happen: Never mind, just let the vote through.

